    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "MusicEvent",
      "id": "a46bebaf1cd2efb7",
      "title": "SUNDAYS AT THE CHURCH",
      "description": "",
      "fullDescription": "The Sunday afternoon light shifts differently in Exarchia. Outside, the square's political murals argue with each other. Inside Burger Disco Club, a different kind of congregation gathers — people who understand that weekends deserve proper endings.\n\nSundays at the Church has established itself as Exarchia's answer to the Monday-morning question. The party begins early by Athens standards, respecting the work week while refusing to surrender the weekend prematurely. The electronic selections keep things moving without the warehouse intensity of Saturday nights — this is about pleasure rather than endurance.\n\nBurger Disco Club provides the setting: intimate, intentionally unpretentious, a space that matches Exarchia's refusal to perform sophistication. The sound system handles electronic music with clarity, the bar serves drinks that fuel rather than sedate, and the room size ensures that dancing means participating rather than observing.\n\nThe crowd arrives with Sunday sensibility. These are people who scheduled their weekends to end here, who understand that the best cure for Saturday night is Sunday afternoon. Students and artists, the neighborhood regulars, whoever followed the Exarchia social calendar to this address. The energy differs from peak clubbing — more smiles, more conversation, more space to actually dance.\n\nIf you want the escalating intensity of prime-time techno, if you need nights that go until dawn, Sundays at the Church operates on different logic. This is the softer closure, the weekend's final breath before reality returns. But if you've been searching for the electronic party that respects both your body and your calendar, that understands Sunday should taste different than Saturday — Burger Disco Club becomes your new church.\n\n| Info | Details |\n|------|---------|\n| **Date** | Sunday, February 22, 2026 |\n| **Venue** | Burger Disco Club |\n| **Neighborhood** | Exarchia |\n| **Price** | Check venue |\n| **Getting there** | Near Omonoia, walking distance |\n\nThe weekend doesn't end. It transforms.",
